\" href=\"/book\">Book Appointment <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"\" style=\"opacity:0;filter:blur(4px);transform:translateY(40px)\"><a class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-xl\" href=\"/services\">Our Services</a></div></div><div class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__heroStatsWrapper\"><div class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__heroStats\"><div aria-label=\"25+ Years Experience\"><div class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__statValue\"><span>0+</span><noscript>25+</noscript></div><div class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__statLabel\">Years Experience</div></div><div aria-label=\"5K+ Happy Patients\"><div class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__statValue\"><span>0K+</span><noscript>5K+</noscript></div><div class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__statLabel\">Happy Patients</div></div><div aria-label=\"4.9 Star Rating\"><div class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__statValue\"><span>0.0</span><noscript>4.9</noscript></div><div class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__statLabel\">Star Rating</div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__pillars\" aria-label=\"Why Choose Us\"><div class=\"container page-module__Q1LIZq__pillarsInner\"><div class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__pillar\" style=\"opacity:0;filter:blur(4px);transform:translateY(40px)\"><h2 class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__pillarTitle\">We work around your day</h2><ul class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__pillarList\"><li class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__pillarPoint\">Morning &amp; evening slots available</li><li class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__pillarPoint\">Book online, anytime</li><li class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__pillarPoint\">Same-week appointments on request</li></ul></div><div class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__pillar\" style=\"opacity:0;filter:blur(4px);transform:translateY(40px)\"><h2 class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__pillarTitle\">Kind care for every age</h2><ul class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__pillarList\"><li class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__pillarPoint\">Gentle treatment for kids &amp; adults</li><li class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__pillarPoint\">Calm, unhurried environment</li><li class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__pillarPoint\">No rush, no judgment — ever</li></ul></div><div class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__pillar\" style=\"opacity:0;filter:blur(4px);transform:translateY(40px)\"><h2 class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__pillarTitle\">Clean tools. Every single time.</h2><ul class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__pillarList\"><li class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__pillarPoint\">Hospital-grade sterilization</li><li class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__pillarPoint\">Strict protocols before &amp; after every procedure</li><li class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__pillarPoint\">Your safety is never a trade-off</li></ul></div></div></section><section class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__services\" aria-label=\"Our Services\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"\" style=\"opacity:0;filter:blur(4px);transform:translateY(40px)\"><div class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__sectionHeader\"><h2>Our Services</h2><p>Comprehensive dental care for your entire family</p></div></div><div class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__servicesGrid\"><a class=\"card page-module__Q1LIZq__serviceCard\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(44px) scale(0.96)\" href=\"/services/general-dentistry\"><div class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__serviceCardImgWrap\"><img alt=\"General Dentistry treatment at Charming Dental Clinic, Negombo\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__serviceCardImg\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 960px) 50vw, 33vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fgeneral%202.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fgeneral%202.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fgeneral%202.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fgeneral%202.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fgeneral%202.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fgeneral%202.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fgeneral%202.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fgeneral%202.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fgeneral%202.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fgeneral%202.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fgeneral%202.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__serviceCardBody\"><h3 class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__serviceName\">General Dentistry</h3><p class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__serviceDesc\">Comprehensive routine care to keep your smile healthy for life.</p><span class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__learnMore\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Learn More <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></div></a><a class=\"card page-module__Q1LIZq__serviceCard\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(44px) scale(0.96)\" href=\"/services/teeth-whitening\"><div class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__serviceCardImgWrap\"><img alt=\"Teeth Whitening treatment at Charming Dental Clinic, Negombo\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__serviceCardImg\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 960px) 50vw, 33vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fteeth%20whitning.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fteeth%20whitning.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fteeth%20whitning.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fteeth%20whitning.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fteeth%20whitning.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fteeth%20whitning.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fteeth%20whitning.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fteeth%20whitning.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fteeth%20whitning.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fteeth%20whitning.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fteeth%20whitning.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__serviceCardBody\"><h3 class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__serviceName\">Teeth Whitening</h3><p class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__serviceDesc\">Professionally brighten your smile by several shades — safely and effectively.</p><span class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__learnMore\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Learn More <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></div></a><a class=\"card page-module__Q1LIZq__serviceCard\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(44px) scale(0.96)\" href=\"/services/aesthetic-treatments\"><div class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__serviceCardImgWrap\"><img alt=\"Aesthetic Dental Treatments treatment at Charming Dental Clinic, Negombo\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__serviceCardImg\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 960px) 50vw, 33vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fservices%2Faesthetic%20dentistry.jpeg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fservices%2Faesthetic%20dentistry.jpeg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fservices%2Faesthetic%20dentistry.jpeg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fservices%2Faesthetic%20dentistry.jpeg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fservices%2Faesthetic%20dentistry.jpeg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fservices%2Faesthetic%20dentistry.jpeg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fservices%2Faesthetic%20dentistry.jpeg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fservices%2Faesthetic%20dentistry.jpeg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fservices%2Faesthetic%20dentistry.jpeg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fservices%2Faesthetic%20dentistry.jpeg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fservices%2Faesthetic%20dentistry.jpeg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__serviceCardBody\"><h3 class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__serviceName\">Aesthetic Dental Treatments</h3><p class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__serviceDesc\">Transform your smile with expert cosmetic dentistry tailored to you.</p><span class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__learnMore\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Learn More <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></div></a><a class=\"card page-module__Q1LIZq__serviceCard\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(44px) scale(0.96)\" href=\"/services/dental-implants\"><div class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__serviceCardImgWrap\"><img alt=\"Dental Implants treatment at Charming Dental Clinic, Negombo\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__serviceCardImg\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 960px) 50vw, 33vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimplant.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimplant.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimplant.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimplant.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimplant.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimplant.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimplant.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimplant.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimplant.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimplant.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimplant.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__serviceCardBody\"><h3 class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__serviceName\">Dental Implants</h3><p class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__serviceDesc\">The gold standard for replacing missing teeth — permanent, natural, and life-changing.</p><span class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__learnMore\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Learn More <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></div></a><a class=\"card page-module__Q1LIZq__serviceCard\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(44px) scale(0.96)\" href=\"/services/orthodontic-treatment\"><div class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__serviceCardImgWrap\"><img alt=\"Orthodontic Treatment treatment at Charming Dental Clinic, Negombo\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__serviceCardImg\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 960px) 50vw, 33vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fservices%2Forthodontic%20treatment.jpeg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fservices%2Forthodontic%20treatment.jpeg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fservices%2Forthodontic%20treatment.jpeg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fservices%2Forthodontic%20treatment.jpeg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fservices%2Forthodontic%20treatment.jpeg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fservices%2Forthodontic%20treatment.jpeg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fservices%2Forthodontic%20treatment.jpeg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fservices%2Forthodontic%20treatment.jpeg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fservices%2Forthodontic%20treatment.jpeg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fservices%2Forthodontic%20treatment.jpeg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fservices%2Forthodontic%20treatment.jpeg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__serviceCardBody\"><h3 class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__serviceName\">Orthodontic Treatment</h3><p class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__serviceDesc\">Straighten your teeth and correct your bite with modern, discreet orthodontics.</p><span class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__learnMore\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Learn More <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></div></a><a class=\"card page-module__Q1LIZq__serviceCard\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(44px) scale(0.96)\" href=\"/services/root-canal\"><div class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__serviceCardImgWrap\"><img alt=\"Root Canal Treatment treatment at Charming Dental Clinic, Negombo\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__serviceCardImg\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 960px) 50vw, 33vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Frootcanal.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Frootcanal.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Frootcanal.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Frootcanal.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Frootcanal.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Frootcanal.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Frootcanal.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Frootcanal.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Frootcanal.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Frootcanal.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Frootcanal.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__serviceCardBody\"><h3 class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__serviceName\">Root Canal Treatment</h3><p class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__serviceDesc\">Save an infected tooth and eliminate pain with expert endodontic care.</p><span class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__learnMore\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Learn More <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></div></a></div><div class=\"\" style=\"opacity:0;filter:blur(4px);transform:translateY(40px)\"><div class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__servicesCTA\"><a class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-lg\" href=\"/services\">View All Services <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__doctorSection\" aria-label=\"Meet the Doctor\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__doctorGrid\"><div class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__doctorImageCol\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-48px)\"><div class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__doctorImageWrapper\"><img alt=\"Dr. Chaaminda Paaris — Expert dentist at Charming Dental Clinic, Negombo\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-fit:cover;object-position:center;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 992px) 100vw, 45vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fdoctor_croped.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fdoctor_croped.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fdoctor_croped.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fdoctor_croped.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fdoctor_croped.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fdoctor_croped.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fdoctor_croped.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fdoctor_croped.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fdoctor_croped.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fdoctor_croped.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></div><div class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__doctorContentCol\"><div class=\"\" style=\"opacity:0;filter:blur(4px);transform:translateY(40px)\"><span class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__doctorLabel\">MEET THE DOCTOR</span></div><div class=\"\" style=\"opacity:0;filter:blur(4px);transform:translateY(40px)\"><h2 class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__doctorName\">Dr. Chaaminda Paaris</h2><div class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__doctorSpecialty\">Chief Dentist</div></div><div class=\"\" style=\"opacity:0;filter:blur(4px);transform:translateY(40px)\"><div class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__doctorQualifications\">BDS (University of Peradeniya)<br/>DHDP (University of Colombo)</div></div><div class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__doctorRegBadge\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px) scale(0.97)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield page-module__Q1LIZq__doctorRegIcon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path></svg><span>SLMC Registration No. 1634</span></div><div class=\"\" style=\"opacity:0;filter:blur(4px);transform:translateY(40px)\"><p class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__doctorBio\">Delivering trusted, ethical and patient-focused dental care with over two decades of clinical experience, combining modern dentistry with a gentle and compassionate approach.</p></div><div class=\"\" style=\"opacity:0;filter:blur(4px);transform:translateY(40px)\"><div class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__doctorExpBadge\"><span class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__expNumber\">25+</span><span class=\"page-module__Q1LIZq__expText\">Years of<br/>Experience</span></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"ReviewsCarousel-module__VlWZtG__section\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"\" style=\"opacity:0;filter:blur(4px);transform:translateY(40px)\"><div class=\"ReviewsCarousel-module__VlWZtG__header\"><h2 class=\"ReviewsCarousel-module__VlWZtG__title\">See What Our Patients Say</h2><p class=\"ReviewsCarousel-module__VlWZtG__subtitle\">Real experiences from real patients who trust us with their smiles.</p></div></div><div class=\"ReviewsCarousel-module__VlWZtG__carouselWrapper\"><button class=\"ReviewsCarousel-module__VlWZtG__navBtn ReviewsCarousel-module__VlWZtG__navPrev\" aria-label=\"Previous reviews\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-left\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m15 18-6-6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div class=\"ReviewsCarousel-module__VlWZtG__cardsGrid\"><div style=\"width:100%;opacity:1;transform:none\"><div class=\"ReviewsCarousel-module__VlWZtG__card\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-quote ReviewsCarousel-module__VlWZtG__quoteIcon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z\"></path><path d=\"M5 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z\"></path></svg><p class=\"ReviewsCarousel-module__VlWZtG__cardText\">I cannot say enough good things about Charming Dental Clinic. I had been putting off a dental visit for almost two years out of pure anxiety, but a friend convinced me to try this clinic and I am so glad he did. From the moment I walked in, the atmosphere felt calm and profession…</p><button class=\"ReviewsCarousel-module__VlWZtG__readMore\">Read more</button><div class=\"ReviewsCarousel-module__VlWZtG__cardFooter\"><div class=\"ReviewsCarousel-module__VlWZtG__flagIcon\"><img src=\"https://flagcdn.com/w40/lk.png\" alt=\"Sri Lanka\" width=\"32\" height=\"22\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div><div><div class=\"ReviewsCarousel-module__VlWZtG__patientName\">Lasitha Pradeep</div><div class=\"ReviewsCarousel-module__VlWZtG__stars\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-star ReviewsCarousel-module__VlWZtG__starFilled\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 