children\":[\"Years of\",[\"$\",\"br\",null,{}],\"Experience\"]}]]}]}]]}]]}]}]}]\nd:[\"$\",\"$L1b\",null,{\"reviews\":[{\"id\":\"752978a3-b30f-4969-9ce8-0e8cef4cb0fd\",\"patient_name\":\"Lasitha Pradeep\",\"content\":\"I cannot say enough good things about Charming Dental Clinic. I had been putting off a dental visit for almost two years out of pure anxiety, but a friend convinced me to try this clinic and I am so glad he did. From the moment I walked in, the atmosphere felt calm and professional rather than intimidating. The doctor was warm, understanding, and did not judge me at all for the time I had spent avoiding the dentist. We came up with a treatment plan together that I felt comfortable with, and we started with a thorough cleaning that made a huge difference. The team genuinely cares about your wellbeing and not just about completing a procedure and moving on. This is the dentist I have been looking for my whole life.\",\"rating\":5,\"created_at\":\"2026-05-31T06:54:41.217917+00:00\"},{\"id\":\"2c49453e-26e6-49f6-a4ce-1ce5be37b2ba\",\"patient_name\":\"Ishara Kumari\",\"content\":\"My experience at Charming Dental Clinic was absolutely fantastic from start to finish. I came in for braces consultation and was amazed by how knowledgeable and honest the doctor was. He showed me a realistic treatment plan, explained the expected duration, and answered every single question I had without making me feel like I was being rushed out the door. The clinic is beautifully maintained, with a relaxing atmosphere that really helps ease the usual dental visit nerves. The booking process was smooth, the staff remembered my name on my second visit which was a lovely personal touch. I have since started my orthodontic treatment and I am already seeing small improvements. Truly a top-tier clinic.\",\"rating\":5,\"created_at\":\"2026-05-26T06:54:41.217917+00:00\"},{\"id\":\"ea1cf955-661b-4e70-b819-e6ccb21f12da\",\"patient_name\":\"Chamara Rathnayaka\",\"content\":\"I visited Charming Dental Clinic for a complete dental checkup and X-rays, and I was really impressed by how thorough and detailed the examination was. The doctor identified a small cavity that I was not even aware of and explained exactly how we should treat it before it gets worse. Everything was communicated very clearly and I never felt rushed. The X-ray equipment is modern and the results were explained to me in simple terms with a digital display which was very helpful. The clinic also maintains a strong commitment to hygiene — I noticed all instruments are properly sterilized and the treatment rooms are immaculate. This is exactly the kind of professional dental care everyone deserves.\",\"rating\":5,\"created_at\":\"2026-05-21T06:54:41.217917+00:00\"},{\"id\":\"7b67db37-6ccf-4983-847f-b40d956a7ed8\",\"patient_name\":\"Thilini Wickrama\",\"content\":\"I had an emergency dental situation — a severe toothache that started on a Saturday evening. I called Charming Dental Clinic and was pleasantly surprised that they were able to accommodate me quickly. The staff were so understanding over the phone and made me feel like I was a priority. When I arrived, I was seen promptly and the doctor diagnosed the issue right away. I needed a root canal, which honestly I was terrified about, but the procedure was done with such skill and care that I barely felt any discomfort at all. After the treatment the pain was completely gone and I could finally sleep that night. I am so grateful for the care I received and will be a loyal patient for years to come.\",\"rating\":5,\"created_at\":\"2026-05-16T06:54:41.217917+00:00\"},{\"id\":\"36888219-6294-4dae-8264-3bb7384a4247\",\"patient_name\":\"Ruwan Bandara\",\"content\":\"Charming Dental Clinic is hands down the best dental clinic I have visited in Sri Lanka. I moved back from abroad recently and was worried I would not find quality dental care here that matched what I was used to overseas. I was completely wrong. The facilities are modern, the doctor is highly skilled, and the level of attention to detail is exceptional. I came in for teeth whitening and the results were outstanding — my teeth are noticeably brighter and the doctor made sure it was done safely without causing any sensitivity. The pricing is also very reasonable for the quality of care you receive. I will not be going anywhere else for my dental needs.\",\"rating\":5,\"created_at\":\"2026-05-11T06:54:41.217917+00:00\"},{\"id\":\"c875ceef-e314-4f3b-8617-f25afb84b18d\",\"patient_name\":\"Dilani Silva\",\"content\":\"Brought my 8-year-old son here for his first dental visit and I could not have asked for a better experience. I was a little worried about how he would react, but the doctor was amazing with children — incredibly patient, funny, and gentle. My son actually enjoyed the visit and has been asking when he can go back! We had a fluoride treatment and a thorough checkup done, and the doctor also gave us some really helpful advice on brushing habits for kids. The clinic environment is very child-friendly and calming. As a parent, it means everything to find a dentist who your child trusts. We will be regular patients from now on.\",\"rating\":5,\"created_at\":\"2026-05-06T06:54:41.217917+00:00\"},{\"id\":\"583cdf9a-1509-4874-8814-1b866a4c2662\",\"patient_name\":\"Kasun Jayawardena\",\"content\":\"I had a dental implant consultation at Charming Dental Clinic last month and I was thoroughly impressed by the level of expertise and care shown by the team. The doctor sat down with me for a full 30 minutes explaining all my options, the procedure timeline, and the costs involved — with zero pressure to commit on the spot. The clinic is well-equipped and very organized. I also noticed how respectful the staff are with every patient, making sure everyone feels heard and comfortable. I have since started my implant treatment and I am very happy with the progress so far. Highly recommended for anyone looking for quality dental care in Negombo.\",\"rating\":5,\"created_at\":\"2026-05-01T06:54:41.217917+00:00\"},{\"id\":\"81dbe1d4-f469-467e-9e89-c95641401254\",\"patient_name\":\"Sanduni Fernando\",\"content\":\"I was terrified of the dentist my whole life, but Charming Dental Clinic completely changed my perspective. I needed two fillings and a deep cleaning done, and I was honestly expecting pain and a stressful experience. Instead, the doctor was so calm and gentle throughout the entire procedure. He noticed I was nervous and kept checking in with me during the treatment, which was so reassuring. The clinic uses modern equipment and I could tell the hygiene standards are top-notch. The online booking system is also very convenient — I got my appointment confirmed quickly and even received a reminder beforehand. This is now my permanent dental home.\",\"rating\":5,\"created_at\":\"2026-04-26T06:54:41.217917+00:00\"}]}]\ne:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"page-module__Q1LIZq__ctaBanner\",\"aria-label\":\"Book an Appointment\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"container\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L1a\",null,{\"className\":\"page-module__Q1LIZq__ctaContent\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"children\":\"Ready for a Healthier Smile?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Book your appointment today — morning and evening slots available.\"}],[\"$\",\"$L5\",null,{\"href\":\"/book\",\"className\":\"btn btn-accent btn-xl\",\"children\":[\"Schedule Your Appointment \",[\"$\",\"$L6\",null,{\"iconNode\":\"$0:rsc:props:children:0:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:children:props:children:2:props:children:0:props:children:props:children:1:props:iconNode\",\"className\":\"lucide-arrow-right\",\"size\":18,\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}]]}]]}]}]}]\nf:[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/chunks/36a71jzwxkofg.css\",\"precedence\":\"next\"}]\n10:[\"$\",\"script\",\"script-0\",{\"src\":\"/_next/static/chunks/2_a_cl5bendso.js\",\"async\":true}]\n11:[\"$\",\"$L1c\",nul